    <item>
      <pubDate>Tue, 26 Sep 2023 09:41:22 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Additional Spots Now Open:  Register to attend a Testing Clinic today!</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">57838302</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3728ade</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/09/8262902/email-banner-civilservice-002_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="CSC Banner " width="600" height="200">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 align="left" style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;">Attend A <strong><em><u>FREE</u></em></strong> Civil Service Testing Clinic</h1>
<h2 class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">
<span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><em><strong>Additional spots available - But they are going FAST! </strong></em></span><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><em><strong>Register Today!</strong></em></span>
</h2>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Are you interested in employment with the City of Columbus, scheduled for a Civil Service exam, or just curious about the City's testing and selection process? </p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Well, we have an information session for you! </p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Civil Service Commission, in partnership with Citywide Training and Development (CTD), will host Civil Service Commission Testing Clinics on the following dates to help you better understand and prepare for the City's testing process. </p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Current City of Columbus employees can register for a Civil Service Commission Testing Clinic by logging into the <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/cityofcolumbus.csod.com/?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21bLdH0Bh1SXiWVyA4mMH_lTisZyjbTPOVQiIPkP0BFItZZCubprtMWUn-3454mq2JorfsJZn1lbMKalcPDxBEJ23ByXKtPQHyhjR2KQ%24=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Training Gateway</a>.  If you are not a current City of Columbus employee, you can register by selecting a date/time below.</p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>• </strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/646090021647?aff=oddtdtcreator&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">City of Columbus: Civil Service Commission Testing Clinic - Friday, October 6 · 1 - 3pm EDT</a></p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>• </strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/646091124947?aff=oddtdtcreator&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">City of Columbus: Civil Service Commission Testing Clinic - Wednesday, October 25 · 8:30 - 10:30am EDT</a></p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">These Testing Clinics are conveniently located at the Jerry Hammond Center, 1111 E. Broad Street Columbus, Ohio 43205.</p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">For questions, please contact Charday Litzy-Taylor, Community Liaison Coordinator, at CMLitzyTaylor@columbus.gov.</p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We look forward to seeing you there! </p>
<p class="04xlpa" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
